# Customer Credit Health Analysis

## Risk Distribution
**55% of customers (205) are Low Risk**, but **High Risk accounts hold 58% of outstanding debt (RM 6.59M)**. Moderate Risk sits between: 38% of base, 39% of exposure. **Concentration risk is severe**—29 high-risk customers drive nearly 3x their customer-count share of outstanding amounts.

## Top Offenders
Three customers dominate delinquency:
- **MY HERO HYPERMARKET SDN BHD**: RM 2.11M outstanding, score 20 (High Risk)
- **MLF TRADING SDN BHD**: RM 1.14M outstanding, score 18 (High Risk)  
- **LO SIEW LIN SDN BHD**: RM 807K outstanding, score 21 (High Risk)

These three alone represent **RM 4.07M (36% of all outstanding)**.

## Key Patterns
- **Over-limit abuse**: SEASONS AGRO SDN BHD at 1,172% utilization; CS 88 FRUITS at 594%. These breach limits massively yet remain Moderate/High Risk—credit controls are not enforced.
